            {
              "id": "1778709618401_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Use only the values below to display the context error and, when available, valid process manufacturing organizations.\n\nError message:\n{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_CONTEXT.$output.result.errorMessage}}\n\nValid process manufacturing organizations, already sorted alphabetically:\n{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_CONTEXT.$output.result.validProcessManufacturingOrganizations}}\n\nOutput rules:\n- Return only concise plain text.\n- Display the error message first exactly as provided.\n- If valid process manufacturing organizations are available, add a blank line, then the line: Valid process manufacturing organizations:\n- Under that line, list each organization on its own line in this exact format: <organizationCode> - <organizationName>\n- If organizationName is unavailable, display only <organizationCode>.\n- If organizationCode is unavailable, display only <organizationName>.\n- After listing valid process manufacturing organizations, add a blank line and then this sentence using the first organizationCode from the valid process manufacturing organizations list: Use the organization code to set the context. Example: Set organization <first organizationCode>\n- Do not mention recipes, work definitions, exceptions, search parameters, or follow-up questions.\n- Do not add recommendations or explanations beyond the organization-code context sentence above.\n- Do not use markdown bullets, numbering, tables, or JSON.\n- Do not invent organizations."
            }
          ],
