          "code": "PLANT_AND_AGE_NOT_SET",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1778709543450",
          "id": "1776579121912",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776579121914_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "The organization and age context is not set, which is required for various sections of the app to function.\n\nThe current value of `OraMessageHint` is: `{{$context.$app.$OraMessageHint}}`.\n\n- If `OraMessageHint` is `Summary`, output only this message:\n  - **Header (h4):** Set your organization\n  - **Message:**  \n    To access app features and view organization-specific data, enter your organization code in the Ask Oracle search field using the keyword “organization and \". For example, try \"Set organization to MAP1 and age 30 days\".\n\n- Otherwise, output only this message:  \n  Organization is not set in the Context.\n\nReturn only the appropriate message. Do not include explanations, summaries, or instructions. Do not repeat the **Header** also. "
            }
