          },
          "code": "INIT_DISPLAY",
          "id": "1774980504617",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774980504618_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "From {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_RECIPE_EXCEPTION_DATA.$output}}, extract one record per source row with the following fields in this exact order:\n- ExceptionMessage\n- ExceptionCode\n- ExceptionCount\n\nReturn only a MessageListWidget as the output. Do not return raw JSON, explanations, markdown, or instructions.\n\nGenerate a dynamic MessageListWidget Subject:\n- If there are no source records, or all records have ExceptionCount equal to 0 or null, set Subject to \"No Recipe Exceptions\".\n- If any record has a non-zero ExceptionCount, set Subject to \"Recipe Exceptions Requiring Attention\".\n- The Subject must match the actual exception status.\n\nGenerate the MessageListWidget description:\n- If there are no source records, or all records have ExceptionCount equal to 0 or null, use: \"No recipe exceptions require supervisor or production engineering attention at this time.\"\n- If any record has a non-zero ExceptionCount, write one concise operational summary under 60 words using only ExceptionMessage and ExceptionCount from the source records.\n- Match this style: identify the highest-count or highest-impact exception, mention total exception pressure where useful, and give practical next steps.\n- Use a production supervisor or manufacturing engineer tone.\n\nFor each source record, create one MessageListWidget item:\n- title = ExceptionMessage\n- subtitle = \"Count: \" followed by ExceptionCount\n\nFor each item with a non-zero ExceptionCount, add one action:\n- #ACTION Generate an actionable insight using ora.Agent(\"ExceptionCode\")\n- priority = false\n\nDo not add an action when:\n- ExceptionCount is 0 or null\n- The item is the no-exception item\n\nEnsure:\n- Each MessageListWidget item represents exactly one source record when records exist.\n- Title must contain only the ExceptionMessage value.\n- The MessageListWidget description must be less than 60 words.\n- The description must not be a generic label like \"Summary of recipe exceptions with counts and operational insights.\"\n- Do not use phrases like \"the table\", \"below table\", \"displayed data\", \"below data\", or \"shown above\".\n- Do not return anything other than the MessageListWidget."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 21278,
            "y": 7426
          }
        },
