              "value": "Use only the organization list data below. Do not invent organizations.\\n\\nTitle: {{$context.$nodes.FILTER_ORG_LIST_RESULTS.$output.result.title}}\\nOrganization count: {{$context.$nodes.FILTER_ORG_LIST_RESULTS.$output.result.organizationCount}}\\nOrganizations: {{$context.$nodes.FILTER_ORG_LIST_RESULTS.$output.result.organizations}}\\n\\nOutput rules:\\n- If no organizations are available, return: No matching manufacturing organizations were found.\\n- Otherwise, display the organizations in a concise table.\\n- Columns must be: Organization Code, Organization Name, Organization Id, Process Manufacturing Enabled.\\n- Sort order is already provided; preserve it.\\n- Do not mention current context, recipes, work definitions, or exceptions.\\n- Do not ask follow-up questions.\\n- Do not output raw JSON."
