              "type": "string",
              "value": "Display the current context parameters using only the values below.\n\nOrganization Code: {{$context.$variables.organizationCode}}\nOrganization Name: {{$context.$variables.plantName}}\nOrganization Id: {{$context.$variables.organizationId}}\nDuration: {{$context.$variables.age}}\n\nOutput rules:\n- Return only the current context values.\n- Do not ask for recipe name, work definition name, item number, or any other search parameter.\n- Do not mention recipes, work definitions, or exceptions.\n- Do not add explanations, recommendations, or follow-up questions.\n- Omit any field whose value is null, blank, or unavailable.\n- Display Duration as \"<value> days\" when available.\n- Use concise plain text.\n\nExpected format:\nCurrent context parameters:\nOrganization Code: <Organization Code>\nOrganization Name: <Organization Name>\nOrganization Id: <Organization Id>\nDuration: <Duration> days"
